WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.711
Good variable names make analytical code easier to
understand Prefer descriptive

00:00:05.724 --> 00:00:10.605
names such as monthly sales patient age or previous
revenue instead of short names that

00:00:10.632 --> 00:00:16.453
only make sense to the person who wrote the code In
Python a common style

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:22.022
is lowercase words separated by underscores Names
cannot begin with a number and

00:00:22.035 --> 00:00:26.627
Python keywords such as if for and class should not
be used as variable names

00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:34.017
Also remember that Python is case sensitive Sales
with a capital S and sales with

00:00:34.043 --> 00:00:40.175
a lowercase s are different names Consistent naming
reduces errors and makes collaboration

00:00:40.201 --> 00:00:41.004
much easier
